  triage:title "health_route.rs From-impl hand-recomputes the same degraded-source classification as doctor_observability.rs degraded_sources with no shared owner or parity test" ;
  triage:description "qa-pr1182-r2 ruthless-boundary-qa (quality-mgr msg 01M1QZ1W1KA2JM9M0YKMQ4XG1E, independently confirmed by quality-mgr). health_route.rs impl From DiagnosticCounters for HealthResponse (line 66) re-implements the degraded predicate that doctor_observability.rs degraded_sources (line 44) already owns; two hand-written copies of one predicate, no parity test between /v1/health output and atm doctor output for the same counters. Fix: one shared classifier used by both routes plus a parity test. Fold into the AW3-QA-I1 remediation." ;
